<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day treasury bill steady.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day treasury bill steady.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Thursday it maintained the cut-off price at 98.05 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 7.98 percent.  </p>
